      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Claimed 40 of 100, active 20, need an intro 4, deals 3, wins 2: where the plan's 90-day targets stand two weeks in. No pilot targets, no on-track labels, no pilot length."
    },
    {
      "id": "_scratch_pilot_preview_issues_05_eccp_activity_view_community_manager_side_step",
